.TH "kreastrap.kg" "5" "" "" ""
.SH NAME
kreastrap.kg \- declarative Kongue configuration for krep rootfs
.SH DESCRIPTION
Rootfs configurations are declarative Kongue documents stored as
.B share/krep/rootfs/arch/ARCH/configs/BUILD_TYPE.kg.
Only literal scalar and list fields are accepted. Functions, commands,
interpolation, mutation, qualifiers, duplicate fields, and unknown fields are
rejected. Only .kg Kongue rootfs configurations are supported.
.SH FIELDS
.TP
.B schema_version
Schema version; currently 1.
.TP
.B build_directory
Rootfs output directory.
.TP
.B package_mode
Either binary or build.
.TP
.B use_overlay
Whether to copy the selected rootfs overlay.
.TP
.B arch, os, libc, compiler, coreutils, init, tls_library
Rootfs profile fields.
.TP
.B package_roots
Optional explicit resolved package roots.
.TP
.B extra_packages
Additional packages installed after core profile roots.
.SH STATE
Provisioning writes
.B rootfs-state.kg
into the root. Only status ready with phase complete is reusable.
